{"number":254,"title":"Debug pill flashes on load before being hidden","body":"The debug pill is rendered visible in the markup on both the Now page and the planner, then hidden once the geolocation callback resolves and reports an in-UK location. For the in-UK majority — everyone at the Fringe — that means the pill pops up on every page load and then vanishes.

The default is backwards. The pill should start hidden and be revealed only when the debug tools are actually relevant: location outside the UK, geolocation denied/unavailable/timed out, or no geolocation API at all.

